---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={SITE_TITLE} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION} />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<h1>Tea Driven Development</h1>
			
			<p>
				I'm a software engineering student, on a journey through computer science, 
				good books, and... the daily cup of tea.
			</p>
			
			<p>
				This blog is where I share what I'm learning in computer science and life.
			</p>
			
			<p>
				In the past three years I have been taking many online courses and following curriculums like OSSU. I'll be sharing my experiences. 
				I believe in the importance of <strong>good teachers</strong>, <strong>fundamental knowledge</strong>, 
				and the power of <strong>reflecting on one's journey</strong>. 
			</p>
			
			<p>
				If you're a fellow student, a developer, or just just interested in learning, 
				I hope you find something useful here.
			</p>
			
			<p>
				<em>~ Ghassen Faidi</em>
			</p>
			
			<hr />
			
			<p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: #888;">
				Check out the <a href="/blog">blog posts</a> or <a href="/about">learn more about me</a>.
			</p>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>